        "content": "<p>Direct links for anyone checking (the project is now mirrored at a stable path in the artifacts repo, alongside the Zenodo bundle):</p>\n<ul>\n<li>project (pinned toolchain + manifests + saved audit output): <a href=\"https://github.com/demonstrandum-research/artifacts/tree/main/problems/p6-moonshot/uc-frankl/lean\">https://github.com/demonstrandum-research/artifacts/tree/main/problems/p6-moonshot/uc-frankl/lean</a></li>\n<li>main theorem: <a href=\"https://github.com/demonstrandum-research/artifacts/blob/main/problems/p6-moonshot/uc-frankl/lean/UCFrankl/DiagonalReduction.lean\">UCFrankl/DiagonalReduction.lean</a></li>\n<li>the entropy-reduction layer I mentioned: <a href=\"https://github.com/demonstrandum-research/artifacts/blob/main/problems/p6-moonshot/uc-frankl/lean/UCFrankl/EngineReduction.lean\">EngineReduction.lean</a>, <a href=\"https://github.com/demonstrandum-research/artifacts/blob/main/problems/p6-moonshot/uc-frankl/lean/UCFrankl/HoBoppana.lean\">HoBoppana.lean</a></li>\n<li>axiom audit: <a href=\"https://github.com/demonstrandum-research/artifacts/blob/main/problems/p6-moonshot/uc-frankl/lean/scripts/CheckAxioms.lean\">scripts/CheckAxioms.lean</a> with <a href=\"https://github.com/demonstrandum-research/artifacts/blob/main/problems/p6-moonshot/uc-frankl/lean/checkaxioms_output.txt\">saved output</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><code>git clone</code>, <code>lake build</code>, then <code>lake env lean scripts/CheckAxioms.lean</code> reproduces the audit.</p>",
